flowchart TB
  GH[GitHub Actions CI / Manual OIDC Release] --> ECR[Amazon ECR - immutable image]
  CLIENT[HTTPS Client + X-API-Key] --> ALB[Public Application Load Balancer HTTPS]
  subgraph VPC[AWS VPC - Two AZs]
    ALB --> API[ECS Fargate API - private subnets]
    API --> SQS[SQS Order Queue]
    SQS --> WORKER[ECS Fargate Worker - private subnets]
    SQS --> DLQ[Dead Letter Queue]
    WORKER --> DDB[DynamoDB - conditional idempotent write]
    API -. Read result .-> DDB
  end
  ECR -. Image pulls .-> API
  ECR -. Image pulls .-> WORKER
  API --> LOGS[CloudWatch Logs]
  WORKER --> LOGS
  DLQ --> ALARM[CloudWatch Alarm - no SNS destination yet]
